The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-17e/">iPhone 17e</a> and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-17/">iPhone 17</a> are among the most affordable iPhones in Apple's current lineup, separated by just &#36;200, but the gap between them is more significant than the price difference alone suggests.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/04/iPhone-17-v-17e-Buyers-Guide-Feature.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-1043462" /><br/>
